# Cross-origin isolation so SharedArrayBuffer is available and ONNX Runtime Web can
# run multi-threaded WASM in production. COEP uses `require-corp` for broad browser
# support; every cross-origin subresource must therefore opt into CORS/CORP:
#   - analytics tracker script and the external site favicons (image-dash, picnook)
#     are loaded with crossorigin="anonymous" and are served with Access-Control-Allow-Origin.
#   - bg2x favicon is served without CORS/CORP headers and stays blocked until bg2x
#     adds its own Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy / Access-Control-Allow-Origin header.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
